  '{"slug":"faq-bot","lang":"ja","recordedWith":"scripted-model","turn":{"prompt":"定期便を次回だけお休みできますか？","steps":[{"kind":"tool","name":"mcp__agent-workspace__search_files","input":{"query":"スキップ"},"output":"[{\\"path\\":\\"faq-bot/ja/HC-103_定期便の変更・スキップ・解約.md\\",\\"page\\":null,\\"snippet\\":\\"--- id: HC-103 title: 定期便の変更・スキップ・解約 section: 定期便 locale: ja updated_at: 2026-11-02 url: https://help.yamagara-coffee.example/ja/articles/HC-103 source: ヘルプセンター…\\"}]","isError":false},{"kind":"tool","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/workspace/faq-bot/ja/HC-103_定期便の変更・スキップ・解約.md"},"output":"---\\nid: HC-103\\ntitle: 定期便の変更・スキップ・解約\\nsection: 定期便\\nlocale: ja\\nupdated_at: 2026-11-02\\nurl: https://help.yamagara-coffee.example/ja/articles/HC-103\\nsource: ヘルプセンターの記事エクスポート（架空のショップ・架空の記事）\\n---\\n\\n# 定期便の変更・スキップ・解約\\n\\n## 締め切り\\n\\nお届け内容の変更、次回のスキップ、解約は、次回の発送予定日の5日前の23:59までにマイページで手続きしてください。締め切りを過ぎると、次回分は発送の準備に入るため変更できません。\\n\\n## 次回だけお休みする（スキップ）\\n\\nマイページの「定期便」から「次回をスキップ」を選びます。スキップは連続2回まで選べます。スキップに手数料はかかりません。\\n\\n## 解約\\n\\n- マイページの「定期便」から「解約する」を選びます。\\n- 定期便は2回目のお届けから解約できます。初回のお届けだけで解約することはできません。\\n- 解約の手数料はかかりません。\\n","isError":false},{"kind":"answer","text":"はい、定期便は次回だけお休み（スキップ）できます。次回の発送予定日の5日前の23:59までに、マイページで手続きしてください。\\n\\n- マイページの「定期便」から「次回をスキップ」を選びます〔定期便の変更・スキップ・解約 HC-103〕\\n- スキップは連続2回まで選べます。スキップに手数料はかかりません〔定期便の変更・スキップ・解約 HC-103〕\\n- 締め切りは次回の発送予定日の5日前の23:59です。締め切りを過ぎると、次回分は発送の準備に入るため変更できません〔定期便の変更・スキップ・解約 HC-103〕"}],"stopReason":"end_turn"}}',
  '{"slug":"faq-bot","lang":"en","recordedWith":"scripted-model","turn":{"prompt":"Can I skip just the next delivery of my subscription?","steps":[{"kind":"tool","name":"mcp__agent-workspace__search_files","input":{"query":"skip"},"output":"[{\\"path\\":\\"faq-bot/en/HC-103_subscription-changes-skips-cancellation.md\\",\\"page\\":null,\\"snippet\\":\\"--- id: HC-103 title: Changing, skipping or cancelling a subscription section: Subscriptions locale: en updated_at: 2026-11-02 url: https://help.yamagara-coffee…\\"}]","isError":false},{"kind":"tool","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/workspace/faq-bot/en/HC-103_subscription-changes-skips-cancellation.md"},"output":"---\\nid: HC-103\\ntitle: Changing, skipping or cancelling a subscription\\nsection: Subscriptions\\nlocale: en\\nupdated_at: 2026-11-02\\nurl: https://help.yamagara-coffee.example/en/articles/HC-103\\nsource: Help-center article export (fictional shop, fictional article)\\n---\\n\\n# Changing, skipping or cancelling a subscription\\n\\n## Deadline\\n\\nChange a delivery, skip the next one or cancel on My Page by 23:59, 5 days before the next shipping date. After the deadline the next delivery is being prepared and cannot be changed.\\n\\n## Skipping just the next delivery\\n\\nOn My Page, open \\"Subscription\\" and choose \\"Skip next delivery\\". You can skip up to 2 deliveries in a row. Skipping is free.\\n\\n## Cancelling\\n\\n- On My Page, open \\"Subscription\\" and choose \\"Cancel\\".\\n- A subscription can be cancelled from the second delivery on. It cannot be cancelled after the first delivery only.\\n- Cancelling is free.\\n","isError":false},{"kind":"answer","text":"Yes, you can skip just the next delivery. Do it on My Page by 23:59, 5 days before the next shipping date.\\n\\n- On My Page, open \\"Subscription\\" and choose \\"Skip next delivery\\" [Changing, skipping or cancelling a subscription HC-103]\\n- You can skip up to 2 deliveries in a row. Skipping is free [Changing, skipping or cancelling a subscription HC-103]\\n- The deadline is 23:59, 5 days before the next shipping date. After it, the next delivery is being prepared and cannot be changed [Changing, skipping or cancelling a subscription HC-103]"}],"stopReason":"end_turn"}}',
